---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
import { SITE } from '../utils/site-config';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="The terms governing your use of this website, including acceptable use, intellectual property, and limitation of liability."
>
  <div class="container--narrow">
    <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Terms of Use' }]} />

    <header class="page-header">
      <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="article-meta">
        <span>Effective date: October 14, 2026</span>
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="page-body">
      <p>
        These Terms of Use ("Terms") govern your access to and use of {SITE.url} (the
        "Site"), operated by {SITE.title}. By accessing the Site, you agree to be bound by
        these Terms. If you do not agree, do not use the Site.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Use of the Site</h2>
      <p>You agree to use the Site only for lawful purposes and in accordance with these Terms. You agree not to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Use the Site in any way that violates applicable law or regulation</li>
        <li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to any part of the Site or its systems</li>
        <li>Interfere with or disrupt the Site, its servers, or networks</li>
        <li>Use automated systems to scrape, harvest, or extract content at scale without permission</li>
        <li>Reproduce, republish, or redistribute substantial portions of content without written permission</li>
        <li>Introduce malware, viruses, or any harmful code</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        All content on the Site — including text, guides, graphics, layout, and design — is
        owned by or licensed to {SITE.title} and is protected by copyright and other
        intellectual property laws.
      </p>
      <p>
        You may view, download, and print content for personal, non-commercial use,
        provided you do not remove copyright notices. You may quote brief excerpts with
        clear attribution and a link to the original page. Any other use requires prior
        written permission.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Informational purposes only — no professional advice</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>
          The content on this Site is provided for general informational purposes only.
          It does not constitute professional advice of any kind.
        </strong>
      </p>
      <p>
        Specifically, the Site does not provide medical, health, legal, financial,
        investment, tax, or licensed trade advice. Guides involving plumbing, electrical
        work, cleaning chemicals, or home repair are limited to routine maintenance
        information. You are solely responsible for:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Determining whether a method is appropriate for your specific materials and situation</li>
        <li>Following all product manufacturer instructions and safety warnings</li>
        <li>Complying with local building codes, regulations, and permit requirements</li>
        <li>Consulting a licensed professional where appropriate</li>
        <li>Testing any method on a small hidden area before full application</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Individual results vary based on materials, product formulations, technique, and
        environmental conditions. We make no guarantee that any method will produce a
        particular result in your circumstances.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Assumption of risk</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>
          You assume full responsibility and risk for any actions you take based on
          information on this Site.
        </strong>
        Cleaning chemicals, tools, heat sources, and repair methods carry inherent risks
        including property damage, personal injury, and exposure to hazardous substances.
        You are responsible for using appropriate protective equipment, adequate
        ventilation, and safe working practices.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, {SITE.title} and its operators,
        contributors, and affiliates shall not be liable for any direct, indirect,
        incidental, consequential, special, or punitive damages arising from or related to
        your use of, or reliance on, the Site or its content. This includes, without
        limitation, damage to property, personal injury, loss of data, or loss of profits.
      </p>
      <p>
        The Site is provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind,
        whether express or implied, including but not limited to warranties of
        merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, accuracy, or
        non-infringement.
      </p>
      <p>
        Some jurisdictions do not allow the exclusion of certain warranties or the
        limitation of certain damages. In such jurisdictions, the above limitations apply
        to the fullest extent permitted by law.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Third-party links and advertising</h2>
      <p>
        The Site contains links to third-party websites and displays third-party
        advertising. We do not control and are not responsible for the content,
        accuracy, policies, or practices of any third party. Links and advertisements do
        not constitute endorsement. Your interactions with third parties are solely
        between you and them.
      </p>

      <h2>7. User submissions</h2>
      <p>
        If you submit corrections, feedback, or other content to us, you grant us a
        non-exclusive, royalty-free, perpetual license to use, reproduce, and display that
        content in connection with operating the Site. You represent that you have the
        right to grant this license and that your submission does not infringe any third
        party's rights.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Modifications to the Site and Terms</h2>
      <p>
        We reserve the right to modify, suspend, or discontinue any part of the Site at
        any time without notice. We may also revise these Terms at any time. Material
        changes will be reflected by updating the effective date above. Your continued use
        of the Site after changes take effect constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Indemnification</h2>
      <p>
        You agree to indemnify and hold harmless {SITE.title} and its operators,
        contributors, and affiliates from any claims, damages, losses, liabilities, and
        expenses (including reasonable legal fees) arising from your use of the Site or
        your violation of these Terms.
      </p>

      <h2>10. Governing law and severability</h2>
      <p>
        These Terms are governed by the laws of the jurisdiction in which the Site
        operator is established, without regard to conflict of law principles. If any
        provision of these Terms is found unenforceable, the remaining provisions remain
        in full force and effect.
      </p>

      <h2>11. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these Terms may be directed through the
        <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
